ank you to everyone playing the demo and sharing feedback. Your feedback is directly shaping Deep Breach as development continues.Play the updated demo now, and if you enjoy it, please consider adding Deep Breach to your wishlist.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:39:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692470","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4389770-1846651706692316","game_id":"steam-4389770","kind":"announcement","title":"Updated Demo Now Available - Windows","summary":"This update focuses on making the early game clearer, smoother, and more satisfying:Improved turret systemReworked layered damage systemComplete fabrication bench overhaul for faster, more direct access to crafting and researchBalance improvements across the demoThank you to everyone playing the demo and sharing feedback. Your feedback is directly shaping Deep Breach as development continues.Play the updated demo now, and if you enjoy it, please consider adding Deep Breach to your wishlist.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:05:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692316","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4389770-1835871199309662","game_id":"steam-4389770","kind":"announcement","title":"Deep Breach Demo for Mac Is Now Available 🍎","summary":"Hello everyone,The Deep Breach demo is now available for Mac.This is the first public Mac build, so I would really appreciate feedback from Mac players, especially about:• Performance• Stability• Graphics issues• Controls• General gameplay feelIf you try it, please let me know your Mac model, RAM amount, and how the demo runs for you.Thank you for playing and helping improve Deep Breach!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-20T16:14:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199309662","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4389770-1835236783567851","game_id":"steam-4389770","kind":"announcement","title":"Deep Breach Alpha Demo Released","summary":"Hello everyone,The first public Alpha Demo of Deep Breach is now available on Steam.Deep Breach is a sci-fi horde survival game where you'll defend the HELIOS facility against escalating alien swarms using research, orbital support, deployable defenses, and customizable weapon loadouts.This is the first public alpha release, which means there is still plenty of balancing, polishing, and improvement ahead. That's exactly why I'm sharing it now — I'd love to hear your honest feedback while develop","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-14T14:48:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783567851","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:04:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4389770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:00Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:00Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4389770":"2026-10-26T12:10:00Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4389770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:00Z"},"4828460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:10:00Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4389770","app_id":43897